### Admin Authenticate to get JWT token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin@cfootprint.com",
  "password": "adminpassword"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.accessToken);
%}
@admin_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NjA5MzQzOSwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MDk0MzM5fQ.QFrn0DrAQNozebgWuQIIu-dq9hN6oOvDmyv2AS7-xpY

### Get Diagnostic Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### List All Badge Definitions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Create New Badge Definition
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/badges
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "badgeType": "TEN_LOGS",
  "title": "Elite Logger",
  "description": "Awarded for logging 10 or more total activities.",
  "iconName": "EliteLogger",
  "iconUrl": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/identicon/svg?seed=EliteLogger",
  "ruleType": "LOG_COUNT",
  "ruleValue": 10.0
}

### Update Badge Definition (Replace {id} with UUID from above response)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/badges/a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "badgeType": "FIRST_LOG",
  "title": "Eco Pioneer (Modified)",
  "description": "Log your first carbon activity on the platform.",
  "iconName": "EcoPioneer",
  "iconUrl": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/identicon/svg?seed=EcoPioneer",
  "ruleType": "LOG_COUNT",
  "ruleValue": 1.0
}

### Delete Badge Definition (Replace {id} with UUID from above response)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/badges/a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### Restored User Management Endpoints
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Get Platform User Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Get All Registered Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/all
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Create User via Admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admincreateduser",
  "email": "createdbyadmin@cfootprint.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "mobileNumber": "+1234567890",
  "age": 30,
  "gender": "Male"
}

### Enable User (Replace {id} with User UUID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/6f288668-27e4-485d-b4cf-33e62a1d6617/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Disable User (Soft Delete - Replace {id} with User UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users/6f288668-27e4-485d-b4cf-33e62a1d6617
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### Restored Activity/Dashboard Analytics Endpoints
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Get Platform Activity Analytics Summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/activities?range=weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Get Platform Activities List (With search filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/activities/list?range=weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
